WEBVTT

00:02.669 --> 00:03.461
Captioning Provided By:
MTV Networks
字幕提供者：
MTV网络

00:03.545 --> 00:04.337
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:04.421 --> 00:05.255
Kids: Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：是的，是的，队长。

00:05.338 --> 00:06.631
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.715 --> 00:08.842
Kids:   Aye, aye,
Captain.
孩子们：是啊是啊
队长。

00:08.925 --> 00:11.511
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.594 --> 00:13.596
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.682
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.765 --> 00:17.600
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.684 --> 00:19.269
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.436 --> 00:21.646
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.730 --> 00:23.022
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.440 --> 00:25.608
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.692 --> 00:27.068
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.152 --> 00:28.069
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:28.403 --> 00:29.738
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.821 --> 00:31.781
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.865 --> 00:33.575
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.658 --> 00:37.245
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

01:05.607 --> 01:07.859
There, there, SpongeBob.
那里，那里，海绵宝宝。

01:07.942 --> 01:09.527
No need to cry.
没必要哭。

01:09.611 --> 01:11.237
Yes, there is, Patrick.
是的，有，帕特里克。

01:11.321 --> 01:14.073
Sandy's been gone
for two whole days.
桑迪已经走了
整整两天。

01:14.157 --> 01:16.075
Two whole days?
整整两天？

01:18.328 --> 01:24.000
Oh, why'd she have to go to that
science convention in Tejas?
哦，为什么她必须去那个地方
科学大会在光辉号举行？

01:24.083 --> 01:26.085
Tejas.
特哈斯。

01:27.545 --> 01:29.589
She won't be back
for one more hour
她不会回来了
再过一小时

01:29.672 --> 01:33.259
26 minutes and 47 seconds.
26分47秒。

01:33.343 --> 01:37.096
Oh, 47 seconds...
哦，47秒...

01:39.140 --> 01:40.809
I miss Sandy so much.
我非常想念桑迪。

01:40.892 --> 01:44.103
Her tentacles, the way
she plays clarinet.
她的触手，方式
她吹单簧管。

01:44.187 --> 01:46.105
Her massive nose.
她的大鼻子。

01:47.398 --> 01:48.691
Patrick, that's Squidward.
帕特里克，那是章鱼哥。

01:48.775 --> 01:52.278
He's not gone, he's right here.
他没有离开，他就在这里。

01:52.362 --> 01:55.448
No, I'm not.
不，我不是。

01:55.532 --> 01:58.034
I sure do miss that squirrel.
我确实很想念那只松鼠。

01:58.117 --> 01:59.369
Her karate chopping.
她的空手道劈砍。

01:59.452 --> 02:01.621
That 10-gallon glass
dome over her dome.
那个10加仑的玻璃杯
圆顶在她的圆顶之上。

02:01.704 --> 02:04.082
And who can forget
those buck teeth?
谁能忘记
那些龅牙？

02:04.165 --> 02:05.625
After Sandy gets back
桑迪回来后

02:05.708 --> 02:08.211
we're gonna let her know
how much we miss her.
我们会让她知道
我们多么想念她。

02:08.294 --> 02:11.172
Is Sandy the one
I call "mom"?
桑迪是那个吗
我叫“妈妈”？

02:11.256 --> 02:12.590
No, Patrick,
that's your mother.
不，帕特里克，
那是你的母亲。

02:12.674 --> 02:14.133
But that does give
me an idea.
但这确实给了
我有一个想法。

02:14.217 --> 02:18.096
We'll throw Sandy the mother
of all welcome home parties.
我们会把妈妈桑迪扔掉
所有欢迎回家聚会。

02:18.179 --> 02:20.306
Patrick, to the tree dome.
帕特里克，去树顶。

02:44.372 --> 02:47.167
Ah.
啊。

02:55.258 --> 02:56.801
Huh?
啊？

03:01.681 --> 03:05.977
We've readied this
place for Sandy's arrival
which should be in about...
我们已经准备好了这个
桑迪到达的地方
应该在大约...

03:06.060 --> 03:07.103
Whoa, right now.
哇，现在。

03:09.314 --> 03:10.773
♪ Welcome home, Sandy ♪
♪ 欢迎回家，桑迪 ♪

03:10.857 --> 03:12.275
♪ You know that we
missed ya ♪
♪ 你知道我们
想念你♪

03:12.358 --> 03:13.443
Man: No!
男：不！

03:13.818 --> 03:15.111
No one wants to hear you sing.
没有人想听你唱歌。

03:15.445 --> 03:18.698
Sorry, SpongeBob, he's got
a fierce no singing policy.
对不起，海绵宝宝，他有
严厉的禁止唱歌政策

03:18.781 --> 03:20.366
That's quite all right,
Miss Cheeks
那就完全没问题了
脸颊小姐

03:20.450 --> 03:24.203
as long as you don't have
a fierce "no partyin'" policy.
只要你没有
严厉的“不参加聚会”政策

03:25.705 --> 03:28.499
First, cake,
then we'll karate chop
首先是蛋糕，
然后我们就空手道砍

03:28.583 --> 03:30.460
and then...
进而...

03:30.543 --> 03:35.089
You two... uh, really know how
to... uh, throw a party.
你们两个……呃，真的知道怎么做
去……呃，举办一个聚会。

03:35.173 --> 03:36.174
I knew it.
我就知道。

03:36.257 --> 03:38.509
You have been itchin'
to see us.
你一直在发痒
来看我们。

03:38.593 --> 03:41.387
Well, something's makin'
my skin crawl.
嗯，有些事情正在发生
我浑身起鸡皮疙瘩。

03:41.471 --> 03:42.597
Maybe a slice of cake
也许是一块蛋糕

03:42.972 --> 03:44.807
will take your mind off
your crawling hide?
会让你忘记
你的爬行隐藏？

03:44.891 --> 03:48.811
Patrick and I made this cake
especially for your return.
帕特里克和我做了这个蛋糕
特别是为了你的归来。

03:48.895 --> 03:51.314
This is gonna taste
so good again.
这会尝到
又这么好。

03:51.397 --> 03:53.191
Dig in, Sandy.
深入挖掘，桑迪。

03:53.274 --> 03:54.692
Uh...
呃...

03:54.776 --> 03:57.111
Looks tasty, SpongeBob.
看起来很好吃，海绵宝宝。

03:57.195 --> 03:58.905
You OK, Sandy?
你还好吗，桑迪？

03:58.988 --> 04:00.156
I'm fine.
我很好。

04:00.573 --> 04:04.243
My skin just hasn't adjusted to
this here underwater air.
我的皮肤还没有适应
这是这里的水下空气。

04:07.789 --> 04:10.541
Uh, hey, Sandy, Sandy?
呃，嘿，桑迪，桑迪？

04:10.625 --> 04:12.794
Surprise, Patrick
and I chipped in
惊喜，帕特里克
我也加入了

04:12.877 --> 04:14.337
and got you a little
somethin' somethin'.
给你一点
某事某事。

04:14.420 --> 04:16.965
Aw, guys, you shouldn't have.
噢，伙计们，你们不应该这样做。

04:17.048 --> 04:20.093
A new itch board...
I mean, a new snow board.
新的止痒板...
我的意思是，一块新的滑雪板。

04:20.176 --> 04:22.762
Boy, I can't wait to scratch
this down chafe mountain.
男孩，我迫不及待地想抓挠
这条查夫山下。

04:22.845 --> 04:24.889
Don't you mean ride
this down scab mountain?
你不是说骑车吗
这山下有痂吗？

04:24.973 --> 04:27.225
Thank you very rawness,
SpongeBob and Pat.
非常感谢你的原始，
海绵宝宝和帕特。

04:27.308 --> 04:29.394
Uh, you're welcome, Sandy.
呃，不客气，桑迪。

04:29.477 --> 04:31.729
Hey, are you still up for
some karate chops?
嘿，你还在等吗
一些空手道排骨？

04:31.813 --> 04:35.191
Rashy sore... I mean, sure.
皮疹疼痛……我的意思是，当然。

04:35.274 --> 04:36.609
You ready?
你准备好了吗？

04:38.403 --> 04:40.196
And how about now?
那么现在呢？

04:40.279 --> 04:41.322
You ready?
你准备好了吗？

04:43.032 --> 04:46.202
Creeping critters, feels like
something's bitin' me.
爬行的小动物，感觉就像
有东西在咬我。

04:51.207 --> 04:52.709
I've got a flea?
我身上有跳蚤？

04:52.792 --> 04:54.961
Well, I ain't gonna take
that without a fight.
好吧，我不会接受
不战而屈人之兵。

04:55.044 --> 04:56.587
Hi-ya!
嗨呀！

04:58.423 --> 05:01.217
I'll get you, hya, hya, hya!
我会抓住你的，嘿，嘿，嘿！

05:03.594 --> 05:06.305
Rrr...
呃……

05:08.558 --> 05:10.685
SpongeBob, ah...
海绵宝宝啊……

05:10.768 --> 05:12.979
My suitcase, hurry.
我的行李箱，快点。

05:14.981 --> 05:16.566
I'm ashamed to say this,
SpongeBob
我很羞愧地说这句话
海绵宝宝

05:16.649 --> 05:20.194
but while I was in Texas, I seem
to have picked up a flea.
但当我在德克萨斯州时，我似乎
捡到一只跳蚤。

05:20.278 --> 05:21.738
What's a flea?
什么是跳蚤？

05:22.071 --> 05:25.491
A flea is a dastardly little
vermin that bites us air
breathers.
跳蚤是一个卑鄙的小东西
咬我们空气的害虫
呼吸者。

05:25.575 --> 05:28.327
But this here flea collar will
send the critter a-runnin'.
但这里的这个除跳蚤项圈会
让小动物逃跑。

05:32.331 --> 05:35.334
He tickles.
他很痒。

05:35.418 --> 05:37.336
Oh, this isn't so bad-
哦，这并没有那么糟糕-

05:37.420 --> 05:40.757
Ow... He bit me.
噢……他咬了我。

05:40.840 --> 05:42.467
Got anymore of those fancy
collars, Sandy?
不再有那些奇特的东西了
项圈，桑迪？

05:42.550 --> 05:45.178
No, but you can use
this one right quick.
不，但你可以使用
这个很快。

05:52.810 --> 05:56.272
Connect the dots.
把这些点连起来。

05:56.355 --> 05:58.232
I drawed a horsie.
我画了一匹马。

05:59.609 --> 06:02.487
Ouch, why does this
flea keep biting me?
哎呀，为什么会这样
跳蚤老咬我？

06:02.570 --> 06:03.488
'Cause he's hungry.
因为他饿了。

06:03.571 --> 06:04.822
When a flea bites ya
当跳蚤咬你时

06:05.156 --> 06:07.533
it's cause he's suckin' up
your blood for nutrition.
这是因为他很糟糕
你的血液的营养。

06:07.617 --> 06:09.535
I've been bitten
by a vampire flea.
我被咬了
由吸血跳蚤引起。

06:09.619 --> 06:10.661
No...!
不...！

06:10.870 --> 06:13.706
I'm going to turn
into a vampire now.
我要转身
现在变成吸血鬼了。

06:13.790 --> 06:16.709
It's already happening.
这已经发生了。

06:16.793 --> 06:19.170
Ah, ah, ah!
啊啊啊！

06:19.253 --> 06:21.506
Pfft...
噗……

06:21.589 --> 06:22.924
Ya-da-da-da-da.
呀呀呀呀呀呀呀。

06:23.007 --> 06:25.343
Patrick, there ain't no such
thing as vampires.
帕特里克，没有这样的
像吸血鬼一样的东西。

06:25.426 --> 06:27.762
Yah, doesn't matter.
嗯，没关系。

06:27.845 --> 06:29.722
Oh, this itch is killing me.
哦，这痒痒得要我的命了。

06:29.806 --> 06:33.142
Nyah... Oh!
尼亚...哦！

06:39.690 --> 06:42.068
Ah...
Give me that!
啊...
给我那个！

06:42.151 --> 06:43.152
Whew.
呼。

06:45.822 --> 06:47.532
Nyah... Oh.
尼亚...哦。

06:47.615 --> 06:50.493
Sandy, please, help me!
桑迪，请帮帮我！

06:50.576 --> 06:51.744
I need this!
我需要这个！

06:51.828 --> 06:54.247
I need it more!
我更需要它！

06:57.291 --> 06:59.210
Eee!
哎呀！

07:32.243 --> 07:35.496
Enough, I will not take
this anymore.
够了，我不会接受
不再这样了。

07:35.580 --> 07:38.374
What ya gonna do now, punks?
现在你们要做什么，朋克们？

07:39.458 --> 07:42.503
Looky, it worked! Whew!
看，成功了！哇！

07:42.587 --> 07:44.297
I'm glad that's over.
我很高兴一切都结束了。

07:44.380 --> 07:47.216
Um, is that what
"over" looks like?
嗯，是这样吗
“结束”是什么样子？

07:48.259 --> 07:51.387
Sandy: Tarnation, they're
multiplying like mad.
桑迪：塔南，他们是
疯狂地繁殖。

07:56.392 --> 07:57.643
Run!
跑步！

07:57.727 --> 07:59.145
OK.
好的。

08:07.486 --> 08:08.654
Oh.
哦。

08:08.738 --> 08:09.614
Huh.
呵呵。

08:09.697 --> 08:12.074
Hey.
嘿。

08:14.076 --> 08:17.997
Y'all got the aim of a
cross-eyed armadillo.
你们都有一个目标
斗鸡眼犰狳。

08:19.457 --> 08:20.666
Ah...!
啊...！

08:20.750 --> 08:22.543
Run again!
再跑！

08:22.627 --> 08:24.170
OK.
好的。

08:24.253 --> 08:25.338
Unh.
呃。

08:26.756 --> 08:28.507
Ah.
啊。

08:29.550 --> 08:30.843
Ah!
啊!

08:30.927 --> 08:33.429
Uh, thanks for having us, Sandy,
but we gotta go.
呃，谢谢你邀请我们，桑迪，
但我们得走了。

08:33.512 --> 08:35.181
Yeah, good to see ya.
是的，很高兴见到你。

08:35.264 --> 08:36.349
Ah!
啊!

08:37.642 --> 08:40.561
: Help, help!
: 救命，救命！

08:40.645 --> 08:42.563
Just ignore them, Squidward
忽略他们吧，章鱼哥

08:42.647 --> 08:44.023
and continue your power walk.
并继续你的力量行走。

08:44.106 --> 08:46.525
Heel toe, heel toe,
heel toe, heel toe.
跟趾，跟趾，
跟趾，跟趾。

08:46.609 --> 08:48.694
Sandy: Back off!
桑迪：退后！

08:52.531 --> 08:55.368
Sandy, oh, no!
桑迪，哦，不！

08:55.451 --> 08:57.286
Are you OK?
你还好吗？

08:59.747 --> 09:01.499
Them varmints is tough.
他们这些恶鼠很难对付。

09:01.582 --> 09:02.625
They're from Texas.
他们来自德克萨斯州。

09:02.708 --> 09:03.793
Whew.
呼。

09:04.001 --> 09:06.796
It's gonna be all right,
we will help you.
一切都会好起来的
我们会帮助你。

09:08.464 --> 09:09.966
OK, you know what?
好吧，你知道吗？

09:10.466 --> 09:13.010
None of this would have
happened if you didn't come back
with your infestation.
这一切都不会有
如果你没有回来就发生了
随着你的侵扰。

09:13.094 --> 09:15.888
All you've brought us is fleas
你给我们带来的只是跳蚤

09:15.972 --> 09:19.725
and trouble and pain and itching
还有麻烦、疼痛和瘙痒

09:19.809 --> 09:23.604
and a rash and pain
and fleas
以及皮疹和疼痛
和跳蚤

09:23.688 --> 09:27.567
and itching and pain.
以及瘙痒和疼痛。

09:27.650 --> 09:31.570
So much pain!
太痛苦了！

09:31.654 --> 09:32.905
So much pain.
太痛苦了。

09:32.989 --> 09:34.907
And as for you...
而至于你...

09:34.991 --> 09:38.911
If you hadn't thrown this party,
we wouldn't be in this mess.
如果你没有举办这个聚会
我们不会陷入这种混乱之中。

09:38.995 --> 09:40.788
Wait a minute.
等一下。

09:40.871 --> 09:43.624
You had as much to do
with this party as I did.
你有那么多事要做
像我一样参加这个聚会。

09:43.708 --> 09:45.251
You call this a party?
你管这叫聚会？

09:45.334 --> 09:47.920
I'm beginning to question
our friendship.
我开始质疑
我们的友谊。

09:48.004 --> 09:49.922
Stop smudging my helmet!
别弄脏我的头盔了！

09:50.006 --> 09:51.382
Oh, I got half a mind, buddy.
哦，我有点不明白，伙计。

09:51.465 --> 09:53.634
Will you two men stop
yelling at each other?
你们两个能停下来吗
互相大喊大叫？

09:53.718 --> 09:55.052
What does that prove?
这证明了什么？

09:55.386 --> 09:57.763
If we're gonna get out of this,
we gotta work together.
如果我们要摆脱这一切
我们必须一起努力。

09:57.847 --> 09:58.931
You're right.
你说得对。

09:59.015 --> 10:00.516
I have an idea.
我有一个主意。

10:00.599 --> 10:03.686
SpongeBob, you get
on Sandy's shoulders.
海绵宝宝，你得到了
在桑迪的肩膀上。

10:03.769 --> 10:05.146
Uh-huh, good.
嗯嗯，很好。

10:05.229 --> 10:08.816
Now...   I'll get
on top of you.
现在...我会得到
在你上面。

10:08.899 --> 10:11.652
Unh, ah.
呃，啊。

10:14.572 --> 10:15.823
Oh, much better.
哦，好多了。

10:15.906 --> 10:16.824
Doh!
哎哟！

10:16.907 --> 10:20.244
I do not play games.
我不玩游戏。

10:23.789 --> 10:25.666
Quick, get in the tree house.
快点，进树屋吧。

10:25.750 --> 10:27.626
It's the only safe place left.
这是唯一剩下的安全地方了。

10:31.172 --> 10:32.798
We should be protected here.
我们应该在这里受到保护。

10:36.385 --> 10:37.636
Hold on.
坚持，稍等。

10:50.232 --> 10:52.276
Is this how we're going
to spend the rest
of our lives?
这就是我们要走的路吗
去度过剩下的时间
我们的生活？

10:52.360 --> 10:55.071
Living in fleas
instead of water?
生活在跳蚤中
而不是水？

10:55.154 --> 10:59.283
SpongeBob, that's
it... water!
海绵宝宝，就是
它……水！

11:00.576 --> 11:02.453
Ha, hi-ya!
哈，嗨！

11:02.536 --> 11:05.706
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha.
哈哈哈哈。

11:06.665 --> 11:08.584
Ya.
是啊。

11:15.549 --> 11:17.510
Water!
水！

11:27.436 --> 11:31.690
: It sure is good
to have you back, Sandy.
: 确实不错
让你回来，桑迪。

11:49.959 --> 11:52.294
Wha, wha... What happened?
什、什……发生什么事了？

11:52.378 --> 11:53.963
Where am I?
我在哪里？

11:57.466 --> 12:00.302
Oh, yeah,
the party.
哦，是的，
聚会。

12:00.386 --> 12:04.306
I must've passed out in
SpongeBob's kitchen...
我一定是昏过去了
海绵宝宝的厨房...

12:04.390 --> 12:06.934
On the ceiling.
在天花板上。

12:07.017 --> 12:09.311
Oof... Oof!
噢……噢！

12:09.395 --> 12:10.771
See, SpongeBob?
看到了吗，海绵宝宝？

12:10.855 --> 12:12.773
I told you we shouldn't
stay up past 8:30.
我告诉过你我们不应该
熬夜超过8点30分。

12:12.857 --> 12:17.862
Things get real crazy
after 8:30.
事情变得非常疯狂
8:30之后。

12:17.945 --> 12:20.990
Would you like another spot
of tea, Ms. Nibsy?
您想要另一个地方吗
尼布西女士，要喝茶吗？

12:21.073 --> 12:22.324
Oh, you would?
哦，你会吗？

12:22.408 --> 12:25.911
Whoo... Chamomile,
chamomile, chamomile!
哇...洋甘菊，
洋甘菊，洋甘菊！

12:25.995 --> 12:29.165
Oh, she really knows how to
pound 'em down, huh, SpongeBob?
哦，她真的知道怎么做
把他们打倒，嗯，海绵宝宝？

12:29.248 --> 12:34.587
SpongeBob... SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝...海绵宝宝？

12:34.670 --> 12:38.424
Sponge...
海绵...

12:38.507 --> 12:41.260
That's a good-lookin' donut.
这是一个好看的甜甜圈。

12:41.343 --> 12:43.387
Wow.
哇。

12:49.018 --> 12:51.645
Oof... Ow!
噢……噢！

12:51.729 --> 12:54.523
What the?
什么？

12:54.607 --> 12:57.985
This donut's connected
to SpongeBob.
这个甜甜圈已连接
海绵宝宝。

12:58.068 --> 12:59.987
Oh...
哦...

13:00.070 --> 13:02.281
Oh...
哦...

13:02.364 --> 13:03.532
It worked.
它起作用了。

13:08.204 --> 13:11.123
A beautiful specimen
of donut-hood.
一个美丽的标本
甜甜圈罩。

13:11.207 --> 13:15.669
A donut this nice deserves to be
served on fine China.
这么好的甜甜圈值得拥有
服务于美好的中国。

13:26.639 --> 13:28.682
The good plate.
好盘。

13:28.766 --> 13:30.267
Don't worry, donut.
别担心，甜甜圈。

13:30.559 --> 13:36.023
No longer will you suffer
the indignity of sub-par
dining wear.
你将不再受苦
低于标准的侮辱
餐饮服。

13:37.608 --> 13:41.445
I don't think I've ever seen
a donut this nice before.
我想我从来没有见过
以前吃过这么好的甜甜圈。

13:44.073 --> 13:47.868
Except maybe that donut
SpongeBob showed me last night.
也许除了那个甜甜圈
海绵宝宝昨晚给我看了。

13:47.952 --> 13:52.164
A donut this nice could
really make a guy happy.
这么好的甜甜圈可以
真的让一个人开心。

13:52.248 --> 13:56.043
Uh...
呃...

14:01.507 --> 14:05.219
This is SpongeBob's delicious...
这是海绵宝宝的美味...

14:08.472 --> 14:09.598
Wai...
哇...

14:09.682 --> 14:13.310
I 'an't eat 'is 'onut.
我“不吃”是“onut”。

14:13.394 --> 14:15.354
It's SpongeBob's.
这是海绵宝宝的。

14:16.689 --> 14:18.357
Go on and eat it.
继续吃吧。

14:18.440 --> 14:19.567
What are you waitin' for?
你还在等什么？

14:19.650 --> 14:22.069
Don't do it,
it's SpongeBob's donut.
别这样做，
这是海绵宝宝的甜甜圈。

14:22.152 --> 14:25.948
Don't listen to him, he's
covered with sprinkles.
别听他的，他是
覆盖着洒水。

14:28.450 --> 14:31.787
I hate conflict.
我讨厌冲突。

14:31.870 --> 14:34.331
It couldn't get any
easier than this.
它无法得到任何
比这更容易。

14:34.415 --> 14:36.750
Just hook a chain to it
只需将链条挂在上面即可

14:36.834 --> 14:38.335
pop it in your mouth
把它放进嘴里

14:38.419 --> 14:41.547
and then when your
sponge friend wants it back
然后当你的
海绵朋友想要回来

14:41.630 --> 14:43.716
just yank it out.
把它拉出来。

14:43.799 --> 14:48.220
I hate to admit it,
but that's a great idea.
我不愿意承认，
但这是个好主意。

14:53.475 --> 14:56.729
Mmm... Ah...
嗯……啊……

14:57.771 --> 15:00.899
And now...
而现在...

15:04.278 --> 15:07.323
SpongeBob's donut,
I ate it!
海绵宝宝的甜甜圈，
我吃了它！

15:11.410 --> 15:14.663
I've gotta sneak this back into
SpongeBob's house before he...
我得把它偷偷带回来
海绵宝宝之前的家...

15:17.666 --> 15:18.917
Hello?
你好？

15:19.001 --> 15:20.085
SpongeBob  :
Hey, Patrick.
海绵宝宝：
嘿，帕特里克。

15:20.169 --> 15:21.879
Ah!
啊!

15:21.962 --> 15:23.631
That was some
party last night, huh, buddy?
那是一些
昨晚的聚会，嗯，伙计？

15:23.714 --> 15:27.134
Ah!
啊!

15:27.217 --> 15:28.052
"Ah!"
“啊！”

15:28.594 --> 15:29.970
Lucky for us, I videotaped
the whole party
我们很幸运，我录了视频
整个聚会

15:30.054 --> 15:32.556
so we can relive it over
and over and over again.
这样我们就可以重温它
一遍又一遍。

15:32.640 --> 15:33.724
Ah, don't watch that tape!
啊，别看那盘录像带！

15:34.099 --> 15:36.769
I'm waiting to watch
it with you, sillyfish.
我等着看
和你一起吧，傻鱼。

15:36.852 --> 15:38.729
I'll be right over.
我马上过去。

15:38.812 --> 15:39.938
Sheesh, Patrick's so excited
谢什，帕特里克太兴奋了

15:40.022 --> 15:41.398
I better not keep him waiting.
我最好别让他等了。

15:41.482 --> 15:43.108
Oh no...
哦不...

15:43.192 --> 15:46.695
That video will show me
stealing SpongeBob's donut.
那个视频会告诉我
偷海绵宝宝的甜甜圈。

15:46.779 --> 15:49.823
Uh-oh, uh-oh, uh-oh,
eee, eee!
呃-哦，呃-哦，呃-哦，
诶诶诶！

15:49.907 --> 15:51.867
I gotta hide this thing.
我得把这件事藏起来。

16:13.389 --> 16:15.474
Phew.
唷。

16:15.557 --> 16:17.851
Oh.
哦。

16:17.935 --> 16:21.063
Hey Patrick, I-
嘿帕特里克，我-

16:21.146 --> 16:22.147
donut!
油炸圈饼！

16:22.231 --> 16:24.483
You monster.
你这个怪物。

16:24.566 --> 16:26.610
You monster!
你这个怪物！

16:33.242 --> 16:35.828
Nothing goes with a video
like toast.
视频没有任何内容
像吐司。

16:35.911 --> 16:37.496
Let's pop
some toast in the toaster
让我们流行吧
烤面包机里放一些吐司

16:37.579 --> 16:39.206
and watch this bad boy.
看看这个坏男孩。

16:40.958 --> 16:43.877
Ow, ow, hot, hot, ow!
呜呜呜，好热啊好热啊！

16:47.005 --> 16:50.342
Get out of the way, Patrick,
I gotta go.
帕特里克，让开，
我得走了。

16:54.430 --> 16:55.639
The attic.
阁楼。

17:01.019 --> 17:04.523
Wait, I don't have an attic.
等等，我没有阁楼。

17:04.606 --> 17:05.774
Oh...
哦...

17:05.858 --> 17:09.236
Oh... Ooh, I know.
哦...哦，我知道了。

17:09.319 --> 17:10.696
The attic.
阁楼。

17:10.779 --> 17:13.031
Ah!
啊!

17:14.575 --> 17:16.285
Hey, Patrick.
嘿，帕特里克。

17:16.368 --> 17:18.370
H-Hey, SpongeBob.
嘿嘿，海绵宝宝。

17:18.454 --> 17:19.663
Are you ready to...
你准备好了吗...

17:20.164 --> 17:23.584
I don't have anything behind my
back, so don't look there.
我的背后没有任何东西
回来了，所以不要看那里。

17:23.667 --> 17:24.710
OK, no problem.
好的，没问题。

17:24.793 --> 17:26.628
Ready to see this?
准备好看看这个了吗？

17:28.464 --> 17:34.052
The official
testament of how heartily
we party... hardy?
官方
证明多么衷心
我们聚会……坚强吗？

17:39.808 --> 17:43.604
No!
不！

17:43.687 --> 17:44.813
I took it, SpongeBob.
我拿走了，海绵宝宝。

17:44.897 --> 17:47.149
I took your donut.
我拿走了你的甜甜圈。

17:47.232 --> 17:50.068
I'm sorry.
对不起。

17:50.152 --> 17:54.490
Oh, Patrick, you really need
to see this video.
哦，帕特里克，你真的需要
观看此视频。

17:54.573 --> 17:57.743
I wanna give you this,
because you're my buddy
我想给你这个
因为你是我的朋友

17:57.826 --> 17:59.036
and a donut this nice
还有这么好的甜甜圈

17:59.119 --> 18:02.748
could really make
a guy happy.
真的可以让
一个快乐的人。

18:05.501 --> 18:08.962
You mean... This is mine?
你的意思是……这是我的？

18:09.046 --> 18:11.590
Of course, it  was  your birthday.
当然，那天是你的生日。

18:11.673 --> 18:13.425
When?
什么时候？

18:13.509 --> 18:16.428
Last night, silly.
昨晚，傻了。

18:16.512 --> 18:19.848
Oh, thanks, buddy.
哦，谢谢，伙计。

18:19.932 --> 18:21.517
Wanna share it?
想分享吗？

18:21.600 --> 18:22.893
Sure, pal.
当然，朋友。

18:22.976 --> 18:26.021
Yum, Yum, Yum...
嗯，嗯，嗯……

18:28.524 --> 18:30.859
Pretty good, huh?
相当不错吧？

18:44.122 --> 18:46.667
Well, good night folks,
come again.
嗯，大家晚安，
再来吧。

18:46.750 --> 18:48.794
Thought those deadbeats would
never leave.
以为那些赖账者会
永远不要离开。

18:48.877 --> 18:50.712
Closin' time,
SpongeBob.
关门时间到了，
海绵宝宝。

18:50.796 --> 18:52.256
There ya go, little buddy.
就这样吧，小伙子。

18:52.339 --> 18:54.842
Now everybody's all clean
and ready for beddy-bye.
现在大家都干净了
准备睡觉了。

18:54.925 --> 18:58.595
Time to pack it in,
SpongeBah...!
是时候打包了，
海绵呸……！

18:58.679 --> 18:59.930
All ready, Mr. Krabs.
一切准备就绪，蟹老板。

19:00.013 --> 19:01.431
Just gotta clock out and...
只需要打卡下班然后...

19:01.515 --> 19:04.560
SpongeBob, what's
the meaning of this?
海绵宝宝，什么
这是什么意思？

19:06.436 --> 19:08.605
Spot, spot, spot!
现货，现货，现货！

19:08.689 --> 19:10.649
That's right, a spot.
没错，就是一个地方。

19:10.732 --> 19:11.817
You know the rule.
你知道规则。

19:11.900 --> 19:13.986
Nobody leaves work till...
没有人离开工作直到...

19:14.069 --> 19:15.696
...Till everything's
ship-shape, sir.
...直到一切都结束
船形，先生。

19:15.779 --> 19:17.030
Don't worry, Mr. Krabs
别担心，蟹老板

19:17.239 --> 19:19.074
I'll get this plate
cleaned up in a jiffy.
我去拿这个盘子
一下子就清理干净了。

19:19.157 --> 19:20.868
Oh, and uh, lock up
when you're done.
哦，呃，锁起来
当你完成时。

19:20.951 --> 19:22.536
Lock up?
Wait, Mr. Krabs.
锁？
等等，蟹老板。

19:22.911 --> 19:26.081
Don't you remember what
happened last time you
left me here alone?
你不记得什么了吗
上次发生在你身上
把我一个人留在这里？

19:29.001 --> 19:30.168
Should have never left you alone
不应该让你独自一人

19:30.460 --> 19:32.504
with a lit blow torch
and me roller skates.
用点燃的喷灯
我和溜冰鞋。

19:32.588 --> 19:36.049
But, since I've removed
all the welding equipment
from the premises
但是，既然我已经删除了
所有焊接设备
从该处所

19:36.133 --> 19:39.761
there's no-ho-ho chance of that
happenin' again, right?
没有那个机会
又发生了，对吧？

19:39.845 --> 19:41.013
Now get to work.
现在开始工作吧。

19:41.096 --> 19:42.764
La la, la la la la la.
啦啦，啦啦啦啦。

19:42.848 --> 19:45.017
Mmm, mmm, mmm.
嗯，嗯，嗯。

19:45.100 --> 19:46.852
Oh, you're a tough little guy,
aren't ya?
哦，你是个坚强的小家伙，
不是吗？

19:46.935 --> 19:49.396
Mmm, mmm, mmm.
嗯，嗯，嗯。

19:49.479 --> 19:51.607
This means war.
这意味着战争。

19:52.816 --> 19:54.610
Ah...!
啊...！

19:54.693 --> 19:57.738
Ah...!
啊...！

20:00.616 --> 20:03.410
Wait here, please.
请在这里等一下。

20:06.705 --> 20:09.791
Say good night, dried-on filth.
说晚安，干涸的污物。

20:09.875 --> 20:11.877
Ready, aim, fire!
准备，瞄准，开火！

20:17.633 --> 20:19.426
That is the last straw!
那是最后一根稻草！

20:19.509 --> 20:21.094
And I want you to remember...
我希望你记住...

20:21.178 --> 20:23.597
: You made me
do this.
: 是你成就了我
做这个。

20:25.724 --> 20:26.767
Argh!
啊！

20:26.850 --> 20:29.102
I got to finish this.
我必须完成这件事。

20:29.186 --> 20:32.189
I am afraid this is
the last time we'll be meeting
like this, my friend.
恐怕这是
我们最后一次见面
就像这样，我的朋友。

20:32.272 --> 20:33.941
Allow me to introduce you to...
请允许我向您介绍...

20:34.024 --> 20:35.233
The Spot-Master 6000.
Spot-Master 6000。
Spot-Master 6000。
现货大师6000。

20:35.609 --> 20:37.819
Notice, the microwave-powered
laser particle beam.
注意，微波供电的
激光粒子束。

20:37.903 --> 20:40.656
Notice, the laser-guided high
pressure water cannon.
请注意，激光制导高
压力水炮。

20:40.739 --> 20:45.243
And notice, the little surprise
I installed just for you.
请注意，这个小惊喜
我专门为你安装的。

20:45.327 --> 20:47.454
A specially-woven metal alloy
特殊编织的金属合金

20:47.537 --> 20:50.290
ingeniously combined with state
of the art cleansing materials.
与国家巧妙结合
艺术清洁材料。

20:50.374 --> 20:54.086
I call it...
steel wool.
我称之为...
钢丝绒。

20:54.169 --> 20:56.588
And it comes with... A laser!
它配备了...激光！

20:56.672 --> 20:58.924
Any last words?
最后还有什么话要说吗？

20:59.007 --> 21:00.342
Mmm, I thought not.
嗯，我以为不是。

21:00.425 --> 21:04.513
Power up.
通电。

21:04.596 --> 21:07.432
Water cannon on.
水枪开。

21:08.058 --> 21:09.977
No effect.
没有效果。

21:10.060 --> 21:14.189
Steel wool laser... On!
钢丝绒激光...开启！

21:18.276 --> 21:20.445
Hmmm, strange vortex
in the west.
嗯嗯，奇怪的漩涡
在西方。

21:20.529 --> 21:22.823
Well, it's probably nothing
to do with SpongeBob.
嗯，可能没什么
与海绵宝宝有关。

21:25.200 --> 21:27.077
OK, you asked for it.
好吧，你自找的。

21:27.160 --> 21:28.453
It may end life as we know it
正如我们所知，它可能会结束生命

21:28.537 --> 21:31.498
but I am crossing the beams.
但我正在跨越横梁。

21:35.127 --> 21:37.379
More power!
更多力量！

21:41.550 --> 21:45.137
Spontaneous molecular
distortion, hmm?
自发分子
失真，嗯？

21:45.220 --> 21:47.639
I guess I better go see
what the lad's up to.
我想我最好去看看
这小伙子在做什么。

21:47.723 --> 21:50.892
More power!
更多力量！

21:50.976 --> 21:52.811
Oh boy, this doesn't
look good.
哦，孩子，这不是
看起来不错。

21:52.894 --> 21:55.605
More power!
更多力量！

21:55.689 --> 21:58.108
Let's see what he's done
this time.
让我们看看他做了什么
这次。

21:58.191 --> 22:02.863
Maximum power!
最大功率！

22:02.946 --> 22:05.782
Ah...!
啊...！

22:16.001 --> 22:18.045
Oh, this time,
ya done it, boy.
哦，这一次，
你做到了，孩子。

22:18.128 --> 22:22.257
What do you got
to say for yourself?
你有什么
为自己说？

22:22.340 --> 22:24.217
The platter's all
clean, Mr. Krabs.
拼盘就全了
干净，蟹老板。

22:24.301 --> 22:27.804
Oh, I'll clean your platter!
哦，我来清理你的盘子！

22:27.888 --> 22:31.683
Come here, you.
过来吧，你。

过来吧，你。